Yagditha sent Zarkga to steal the Quintessence and kill me. I escaped thanks to Lirie, the leader of the Priestesses.
Zarkga was defeated, but the Quintessences were taken.

I made the Quintessence with the teachings of Pythia, Zarad's mother. She knows the water people's Fusion technique and lived hidden on the surface. I made them to stop the Black Tide. But Yagditha is using them to create more Shogoth from the bodies of Pristonians. Their souls deserve to rest.

Let me see that... These souls hold the essence of Yagditha's evil. I need some time to study them.
Take the chance to restock your supplies and come back later.

